cuems-common (1.3.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Network interfaces: stop shipping /etc/network/interfaces as a conffile (it
    is host- and role-specific) and replace the obsolete dpkg-divert +
    interfaces.cuems mechanism. On FIRST install only, postinst takes over
    /etc/network/interfaces with a reachable baseline
    (/usr/share/cuems/interfaces.master), preserving any pre-existing file (e.g.
    the debian-installer default) at .dpkg-old; on upgrades it is never touched
    (operator / clone / role-template config wins). This is necessary because a
    stock Debian interfaces names the original NICs, which our .link files
    rename to ethernet0/ethernet1/wifi0 -- the stock file would otherwise go
    stale and drop the network. Role templates (interfaces.master /
    interfaces.node) still ship under /usr/share/cuems/. The old diversion is
    removed cleanly (without --rename, leaving the live file as-is) and the
    stale .dpkg-old dropped.

 -- Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>  Mon, 01 Jun 2026 12:58:58 +0200

cuems-common (1.3.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * rtpmidid: gate node startup on controller reachability via the
    cuems-wait-controller ExecStartPre, fixing the cold-boot MTC zombie
    where rtpmidid raced an unconfigured link-local route (control channel
    up, no MTC data). No-op on controllers.
  * videocomposer: wait for Plymouth to release DRM master before start,
    fixing black panels (modeset "Permission denied") after boot.
  * rtpmidid: set explicit port=5004 in the node [connect_to].
  * Ship cuems-power-bridge poweroff sudoers; Shelly power-bridge support.
  * network: persist Wake-on-LAN via post-up ethtool in interfaces.
  * link files: correct 10-wifi0.link Path= to N97 default; document the
    RTL8852BE driver gap on stock bookworm.
  * Incorporate the debian/bookworm packaging line (merge): controller-engine
    LD_LIBRARY_PATH for python_rtmidi's bundled libjack; CPU governor set to
    performance + self-signed SSL cert provisioning in postinst; control
    dependency refresh (add cpufrequtils, avahi-autoipd, libapache2-mod-dnssd,
    ifenslave, net-tools; Conflicts network-manager; ddcutil promoted to
    Depends); xinitrc.cuems conffile override. Built on the
    debian/bookworm-pre_release_1 integration branch.

 -- Ion Reguera <ion@stagelab.coop>  Mon, 01 Jun 2026 12:15:52 +0200

cuems-common (1.3.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix 10-ethernet0.link Path= to N97 default (pci-0000:01:00.0; was
    pci-0000:03:00.0 which is the wifi slot on controller hardware).
    Adds link-files.README documenting the hardware-mismatch hazard.

